          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "# KASwitcher\n\nClose all apps in the app switcher at once.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Close all** — hold the X button, tap Close All\n- **Undo** — tap the X during the countdown\n- **Pin** — hold a card; pinned apps are not closed\n- **Protect** — music and maps, plus any apps you choose\n- **Keep the most recent** app open\n- **Cascade animation** — style and speed\n- **Move and resize** the X button, portrait and landscape\n\n## Languages\n\nTürkçe · English · Deutsch · Français · Español · Italiano · Português · Русский · 简体中文 · 日本語 · 한국어 · العربية\n\n## Requirements\n\n- iOS 16 or later\n- RootHide or rootless\n- PreferenceLoader"
